  </div>
  <figcaption style="font-size:13px;color:var(--on-dark-muted);margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic">Nested, stacked, seated on lids — the storage story is the design story.</figcaption>

  <div class="gal">
    <figure><img src="/assets/img/mixing-bowls/early-scoop.jpg" alt="Cutaway of the scooped rim detail" loading="lazy" /></figure>
